== Trivia ==
* The achievement for unlocking Tainted Cain is "The Hoarder", a possible title for the character.
* Tainted Cain's description of "No Destiny" on the character selection screen implies that "Destiny" is the designated items set to appear every time in a random seed.
** This is backed by the description of {{I|The D6}}, being "Reroll your destiny".
* Tainted Cain's inability collect items normally may reference Biblical Cain's curse that he may not "farm the land".
* Defeating {{E|Ultra Greedier}} as Tainted Cain unlocks {{P|X - Wheel of Fortune?}}, a reversed Major Arcana card associated with increase and superfluity. This is likely a deliberate choice, as it parallels Tainted Cain's gameplay featuring a dramatic excess of pickups.
* Tainted Cain's Bag Of Crafting was originally planned by Edmund to "collect" enemy projectiles to shoot a bigger projectile back at them, then was changed to the crafting mechanic.

